b1 is a text with value "Console programming", size 40, weight 800, foreground "#0b1d36", letterspacing "-0.03em", lineheight "1.1"
b2 is a text with value "A console program talks to the person through a terminal: it prints, asks, and can use colors, menus and progress bars. Everything here works when you run a program with otter run.", size 18, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.55"
b3 is a text with value "Colors, cursor positioning, menus, progress bars and secret input are console features. The web and Windows targets report them as unsupported instead of silently doing something different.", size 15, foreground "#1e3a6b", background "#eaf2ff", radius 12, border "1px solid #cfe0ff", lineheight "1.55", customstyle "padding: 14px 18px;"
b4 is a text with value "Saying things", size 26, weight 800, foreground "#0b1d36", letterspacing "-0.02em", margin "14px 0 0 0"
b5 is a text with value "say \"Hello\"\nsay \"Total:\" 42 \"items\"\nsay", size 14, foreground "#e5edf8", background "#0f1b2e", radius 12, fontfamily "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace", whitespace "pre", customstyle "padding: 18px 22px; line-height: 1.7; overflow-x: auto; border-top-left-radius: 0; border-top-right-radius: 0;", runnable true
b5label is a text with value "Otter", size 12, weight 600, foreground "#b7c4d8"
b5copy is a button with text "Copy", size 12, weight 600, background "#22375a", foreground "#e5edf8", radius 6, padding "4px 12px"
b5head is a row with spread, align middle, width full, background "#16263f", padding "8px 14px", customstyle "box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;"
put b5label, b5copy in b5head
b5block is a column with spacing 0, width full
put b5head, b5 in b5block
when b5copy is clicked
    copy text of b5 to clipboard
    text of b5copy is "Copied"
.
b6 is a text with value "say prints its values on one line with single spaces between them. With nothing after it, it prints a blank line.", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b7 is a text with value "Color", size 26, weight 800, foreground "#0b1d36", letterspacing "-0.02em", margin "14px 0 0 0"
b8 is a text with value "say \"Error!\" in color \"red\"\nsay \"Success\" in color \"green\"", size 14, foreground "#e5edf8", background "#0f1b2e", radius 12, fontfamily "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace", whitespace "pre", customstyle "padding: 18px 22px; line-height: 1.7; overflow-x: auto; border-top-left-radius: 0; border-top-right-radius: 0;", runnable true
b8label is a text with value "Otter", size 12, weight 600, foreground "#b7c4d8"
b8copy is a button with text "Copy", size 12, weight 600, background "#22375a", foreground "#e5edf8", radius 6, padding "4px 12px"
b8head is a row with spread, align middle, width full, background "#16263f", padding "8px 14px", customstyle "box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;"
put b8label, b8copy in b8head
b8block is a column with spacing 0, width full
put b8head, b8 in b8block
when b8copy is clicked
    copy text of b8 to clipboard
    text of b8copy is "Copied"
.
b9 is a text with value "The colors are red, green, yellow, blue, cyan, magenta, white, gray, darkgray, darkred, darkgreen, darkyellow, darkblue, darkcyan, darkmagenta and black. An unknown color name is an error that lists the valid ones - it never quietly prints in the default color.", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b10 is a text with value "Progress", size 26, weight 800, foreground "#0b1d36", letterspacing "-0.02em", margin "14px 0 0 0"
b11 is a text with value "show progress 25 percent\nshow progress 50 percent\nshow progress 100 percent", size 14, foreground "#e5edf8", background "#0f1b2e", radius 12, fontfamily "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace", whitespace "pre", customstyle "padding: 18px 22px; line-height: 1.7; overflow-x: auto; border-top-left-radius: 0; border-top-right-radius: 0;", runnable true
b11label is a text with value "Otter", size 12, weight 600, foreground "#b7c4d8"
b11copy is a button with text "Copy", size 12, weight 600, background "#22375a", foreground "#e5edf8", radius 6, padding "4px 12px"
b11head is a row with spread, align middle, width full, background "#16263f", padding "8px 14px", customstyle "box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;"
put b11label, b11copy in b11head
b11block is a column with spacing 0, width full
put b11head, b11 in b11block
when b11copy is clicked
    copy text of b11 to clipboard
    text of b11copy is "Copied"
.
b12 is a text with value "[##########----------] 50%", size 14, foreground "#0f1f36", background "#e8eef7", radius 12, fontfamily "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace", whitespace "pre", customstyle "padding: 16px 22px; line-height: 1.7; overflow-x: auto; border-top-left-radius: 0; border-top-right-radius: 0;"
b12label is a text with value "Output", size 12, weight 600, foreground "#4a5b75"
b12copy is a button with text "Copy", size 12, weight 600, background "#c9d6e8", foreground "#0f1f36", radius 6, padding "4px 12px"
b12head is a row with spread, align middle, width full, background "#dde6f2", padding "8px 14px", customstyle "box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;"
put b12label, b12copy in b12head
b12block is a column with spacing 0, width full
put b12head, b12 in b12block
when b12copy is clicked
    copy text of b12 to clipboard
    text of b12copy is "Copied"
.
b13 is a text with value "Each call redraws the bar on the same line. The value must be between 0 and 100; anything else is an error rather than being clamped. A say after a progress bar starts on a fresh line.", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b14 is a text with value "Cursor", size 26, weight 800, foreground "#0b1d36", letterspacing "-0.02em", margin "14px 0 0 0"
b15 is a text with value "set cursor to row 5 column 10", size 14, foreground "#e5edf8", background "#0f1b2e", radius 12, fontfamily "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace", whitespace "pre", customstyle "padding: 18px 22px; line-height: 1.7; overflow-x: auto; border-top-left-radius: 0; border-top-right-radius: 0;", runnable true
b15label is a text with value "Otter", size 12, weight 600, foreground "#b7c4d8"
b15copy is a button with text "Copy", size 12, weight 600, background "#22375a", foreground "#e5edf8", radius 6, padding "4px 12px"
b15head is a row with spread, align middle, width full, background "#16263f", padding "8px 14px", customstyle "box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;"
put b15label, b15copy in b15head
b15block is a column with spacing 0, width full
put b15head, b15 in b15block
when b15copy is clicked
    copy text of b15 to clipboard
    text of b15copy is "Copied"
.
b16 is a text with value "Rows and columns count from 1. Moving the cursor only makes sense in a real terminal.", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b17 is a text with value "Are we in a real terminal?", size 26, weight 800, foreground "#0b1d36", letterspacing "-0.02em", margin "14px 0 0 0"
b18 is a text with value "if console is interactive\n    say \"Running in a real terminal.\"\notherwise\n    say \"Running noninteractively - skipping the progress bar.\"\n.", size 14, foreground "#e5edf8", background "#0f1b2e", radius 12, fontfamily "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace", whitespace "pre", customstyle "padding: 18px 22px; line-height: 1.7; overflow-x: auto; border-top-left-radius: 0; border-top-right-radius: 0;", runnable true
b18label is a text with value "Otter", size 12, weight 600, foreground "#b7c4d8"
b18copy is a button with text "Copy", size 12, weight 600, background "#22375a", foreground "#e5edf8", radius 6, padding "4px 12px"
b18head is a row with spread, align middle, width full, background "#16263f", padding "8px 14px", customstyle "box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;"
put b18label, b18copy in b18head
b18block is a column with spacing 0, width full
put b18head, b18 in b18block
when b18copy is clicked
    copy text of b18 to clipboard
    text of b18copy is "Copied"
.
b19 is a text with value "console is interactive is false when input or output is redirected - for example when the program runs in a scheduled task or its output goes to a file. Check it before using colors, menus or progress bars in a program that others may automate. if not console is interactive covers noninteractive environments.", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b20 is a link with text "Console input", url "/console-input/", foreground "#2563eb", weight 600, size 15
b21 is a link with text "A complete console program", url "/console-app/", foreground "#2563eb", weight 600, size 15

docsMain is a column with spacing 16, flex 1, padding "40px 56px 24px", customstyle "box-sizing: border-box; min-width: 0; max-width: 940px;"
put b1, b2, b3, b4, b5block, b6, b7, b8block, b9, b10, b11block, b12block, b13, b14, b15block, b16, b17, b18block, b19, b20, b21 in docsMain
docsBody is a row with align top, spacing 0, width full, customstyle "align-items: stretch;"
put docsSidebar, docsMain in docsBody

put topBar, docsBody, siteFooter in app
show app
